            "reason": "ai_stp#424 asks for a project-scoped command route. No Antigravity page names a commands directory at any scope: the slash commands the CLI documents are its own built-ins (/skills, /mcp, /agents), not user-authored files. Declared the day a vendor page names the path and not before -- a declared kind is a promise of a rollback.",
